ing of freedom...Comment: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:31.32,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Now...  Now, oh yes, we can!Comment: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:38.64,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yes, we can!Comment: 0,0:01:35.34,0:01:37.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:03.67,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kono sekai no hate nanteComment: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:06.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kono me de mita wake janaiComment: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:13.95,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Dakara tabidatsun da kimi to, WII KYAN!Comment: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:27.00,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Umi kara umi wo mata ni kaketeComment: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:31.91,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Daremo ga waratteiru kedoComment: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:38.78,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Souzou tsukanaikoto bakari daroComment: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:43.56,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Miteminufuri suruna yoComment: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:50.04,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Joushiki nante sa tasuuketsuComment: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:54.08,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kono sekai no hate nanteComment: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:57.41,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kono me de mita wake janaiComment: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:01.96,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Dakara ikou ze AMANO JYAKKU senchouComment: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:04.72,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Dekiyashinai koto tte nani?Comment: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:07.89,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Mada nani mo hajimatte naiComment: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:12.72,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Subete shiritain da ima, IESU WII KYANComment: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:18.68,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,IESU WII KYAN! YUU KYAN! Kono shunkanComment: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:24.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,WII KYAN! AI KYAN! Kono kaikanComment: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:31.32,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Ima ima, OO IESU WII KYAN!Comment: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:38.64,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,IESU WII KYAN!Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.82,Kanji,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:03.67,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,この世｜せ界｜か#｜いの果｜はてなんてComment: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:06.82,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,この目｜めで見｜みたわけじゃないComment: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:13.95,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,だから旅｜た#｜び立｜!だつんだ 君｜き#｜みとウィーキャン！Comment: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:27.00,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,海｜う#｜みから海｜う#｜みを股｜ま#｜たにかけてComment: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:31.91,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,誰｜だ#｜れもが笑｜わ#｜らっているけどComment: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:38.78,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,想｜そう像｜!ぞ#｜うつかない真｜こ実｜!とばかりだろComment: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:43.56,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,見｜みて見｜みぬ振｜ふりするなよComment: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:50.04,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,常｜じょ#｜う識｜!し#｜きなんてさ 多｜た数｜!す#｜う決｜!け#｜つComment: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:54.08,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,この世｜せ界｜か#｜いの果｜はてなんてComment: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:57.41,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,この目｜めで見｜みたわけじゃないComment: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:01.96,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,だから行｜いこうぜ アマノジャック船｜せん長｜!ちょうComment: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:04.72,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,出｜で来｜!きやしないことって何｜な#｜に？Comment: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:07.89,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,まだ何｜な#｜にも始｜は#｜じまってないComment: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:12.72,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,すべて知｜しりたいんだ 今｜い#｜まイエス・ウィーキャン！Comment: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:18.68,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,イエス・ウィーキャン！ユー・キャン！ この瞬｜しゅ#｜ん間｜!か#｜んComment: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:24.10,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,ウィーキャン！アイキャン！ この快｜か#｜い感｜!か#｜んComment: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:31.32,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,今｜い#｜ま 今｜い#｜ま オー・イエス・ウィーキャン！Comment: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:38.64,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,イエス・ウィーキャン！Comment: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:36.99,Sanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,Diable Jambe!Comment: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:38.34,Sanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,Collier...Comment: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:43.18,Sanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,... Shoot!Comment: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:02.66,Judge,,0,0,0,karaoke,Electromagnetic Crack!Comment: 0,0:10:04.59,0:10:06.49,Judge,,0,0,0,karaoke,Blaster!Comment: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:53.13,Sanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,Poêle à Frire...Comment: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:03.41,Judge,,0,0,0,karaoke,Wall.Comment: 0,0:12:34.65,0:12:38.02,Judge,,0,0,0,karaoke,E. M. Shaft!Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.54,0:01:45.41,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a duel!Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:49.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Generalissimo will fight the fabled Sanji-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.48,0:01:50.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-sama?Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.71,0:01:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of guy is he?!Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:54.67,Main,,0,0,0,,We know a bit about how he looks, at least!Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.63,0:01:59.09,Captions,,0,0,0,,Yonji's Castle, the Germa KingdomDialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:03.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard he was still refusing to marry,Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.98,0:02:05.93,Main,,0,0,0,,so I tried to teach him a lesson on Father's behalf.Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:08.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Just like the old days.Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:13.98,Main,,0,0,0,,And this is what happened! He'll pay for this! Sanji, that asshole!Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:17.61,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Yonji-sama, a hammer won't do.Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:28.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna press it. Stay still.Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:33.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fixed.Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:43.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! That bastard! He's just a failure...Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.17,0:02:46.18,Title,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke JudgeDialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:48.83,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's Sanji-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:55.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Anytime.Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.61,0:02:59.70,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:02.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Here I come!Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:22.82,Main,,0,0,0,,What speed!Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:26.76,Main,,0,0,0,,That's just what you'd expect from a wanted pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:43.90,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you kick your real father!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:46.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut it out! You started this!Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:50.83,Main,,0,0,0,,And you'd better stop saying that you're my father!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:56.70,Main,,0,0,0,,You're my son who came back! Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.70,0:03:59.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't say that while you're attacking me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.49,0:04:00.82,Main,,0,0,0,,He's strong!Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:03.40,Main,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even have a Raid Suit on!Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:08.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go back to my pirate ship as soon as the tea party ends.Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:10.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll just pretend to marry her!Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:12.23,Main,,0,0,0,,You're still saying that?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:19.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You just want the bond between you guys and Big Mom, don't you?Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.73,0:04:22.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Then it doesn't matter where I end up!Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:24.52,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't do that!Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:27.12,Main,,0,0,0,,It would be seen as the Vinsmoke Family's betrayal!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:29.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You think Big Mom would allow that?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:34.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens to you guys afterward.Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:38.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I just came here to protect my friends!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:40.55,Main,,0,0,0,,You would forsake your own family?!!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:45.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are not my family!Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.47,0:04:50.92,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He was in the kitchen, as I thought.Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:54.78,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He was making food for rats again!Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:04:59.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Royalty mustn't cook.Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:03.44,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Give it back!Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:06.74,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Ouch...Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.41,0:05:11.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:13.25,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:17.63,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He's so weak and pathetic!Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:19.54,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We were all born on the same day!Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:22.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Why are you such a failure, while we're not?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.77,0:05:35.56,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You failure!Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:50.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Oh, Father!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.24,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Are you beating up Sanji again?Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:05:59.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Help me!Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:02.21,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:05.36,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Why?Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:10.09,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,"Why?"Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.09,0:06:15.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I don't think you're gonna be a good soldier in the future.Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:19.35,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I have no obligation to help you, and you're not worth raising.Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:27.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.27,0:06:30.66,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're a disgrace to our family!Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:43.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Stand up! I'll train you!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.09,0:06:47.88,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A disgrace to the Vinsmokes!Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:50.35,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and make a charge at him, Yonji.Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:52.09,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:23.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you remember something?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:27.05,Main,,0,0,0,,He blocked the blade with his leg!Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.59,0:07:34.60,Main,,0,0,0,,To think the Sanji I knew can now use Haki...Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:36.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me a sword!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:38.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:43.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Take it.Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.18,0:07:46.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought I taught you how to use a sword.Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:59.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna use my hands for such crap.Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:10.63,Main,,0,0,0,,My hands...Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.63,0:08:13.55,Main,,0,0,0,,... are for cooking only.Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.79,0:08:49.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that weak little Sanji became this strong...Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:52.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Cooking? That's absurd!Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:58.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you still cook for rats? Royalty mustn't offer services!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:08:59.69,Main,,0,0,0,,How embarrassing!Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:02.18,Main,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:13.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What problem do you have with this marriage?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:25.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Generalissimo's hand-to-hand combat!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:27.75,Main,,0,0,0,,The fighting style of the man who is known as the "Garuda"!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:29.84,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a rare sight to behold!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:33.88,Main,,0,0,0,,An aerial attack? Ironically, this is my forte.Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:58.41,Main,,0,0,0,,War advances science!Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:30.84,Main,,0,0,0,,The Germa that you once knew is a thing of the past now!Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:57.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey...Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:00.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you something?Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:08.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you think being a biological parent entitles someone to respect?Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.81,0:11:11.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't...Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:20.15,Main,,0,0,0,,... even have a single good memory of him, do you?Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:27.99,Main,,0,0,0,,You...Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:31.58,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Father! Let me out!Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:34.88,Main,,0,0,0,,... suffered so much.Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.34,0:11:47.56,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Father! It's too dark!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.54,0:11:58.23,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You only have animosity... towards him.Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:10.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, move!Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:04.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You're tough as nails. I'm surprised.Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:13.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're that weak little Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:14.82,Main,,0,0,0,,This is getting ridiculous.Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:17.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna attend the tea party and get out of here already.Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:21.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I'm gonna be free from the curse of Big Mom's invitation.Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.53,0:13:26.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you might've changed a little, but you actually got worse!Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:29.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of this room, old man! You're a stranger to me!Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.99,0:13:35.41,Main,,0,0,0,,No, you have my blood in your veins.Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:39.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong. All Germa soldiers are...Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.08,0:13:46.80,Main,,0,0,0,,... followers who are willing to die for the Vinsmoke Family at a moment's notice!Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:50.97,Main,,0,0,0,,They're Germa's biggest military force!Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:58.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, why don't you make your stupid dream come true using them?Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:14:04.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Conquering the North Blue? Great! That's perfect for an evil organization.Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.10,0:14:07.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You're quick on the uptake. That's right.Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.65,0:14:09.86,Main,,0,0,0,,By joining hands with Big Mom,Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.86,0:14:12.62,Main,,0,0,0,,it'll become an objective I can achieve for sure!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:15.87,Main,,0,0,0,,An objective I can achieve for sure!Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.46,0:14:23.00,Main,,0,0,0,,If you can understand that, I have nothing left to say.Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.89,0:14:28.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted to settle this with you peacefully somehow, but...Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:37.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I need Big Mom's help, but the condition is establishing blood ties.Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:39.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just a marriage,Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.78,0:14:45.11,Main,,0,0,0,,but I can't let any of my precious sons marry someone from that crazy old bag's family!Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.61,0:14:51.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I remembered having another son...Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:54.24,Main,,0,0,0,,... who was a failure.Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:59.23,Main,,0,0,0,,You are a sacrifice, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.23,0:15:02.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I haven't changed.Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:06.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think of you as my son even one bit!Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:13.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are these?Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.47,0:15:16.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You said your hands are important to you.Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:17.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That's great.Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.39,0:15:23.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know the shackle collars that the slaves to the Celestial Dragons wear?Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.61,0:15:28.32,Main,,0,0,0,,If they try to escape from their masters, they'll explode along with their heads.Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:30.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Those work the same way.Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:34.95,Main,,0,0,0,,If you try to get off of this island, your hands will be blown off!Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.45,0:15:37.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw you! Take them off!Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:41.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom had the foresight to lend them to me.Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.46,0:15:44.13,Main,,0,0,0,,She has the key.Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:45.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.34,0:15:51.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do that.Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:57.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't try to rip them off.Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.93,0:16:02.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Using the key is the only way to take them off, of course.Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.32,0:16:08.07,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't escape.Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:10.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, first of all,Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.91,0:16:15.12,Main,,0,0,0,,we Germa won't let you get away!Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:20.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You have to get married!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:29.34,Captions,,0,0,0,,Somewhere Around the Capital – Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:16:25.89,0:16:29.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Extra! Extra!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:32.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss Jinbe betrayed us?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:35.05,Main,,0,0,0,,This happened between him and Mama yesterday?Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.31,0:16:42.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss Jinbe was so cool when he stopped Mama's tantrum.Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.31,0:16:45.56,Main,,0,0,0,,He blustered that he wanted to leave her crew,Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:49.28,Main,,0,0,0,,but he got scared of paying the price and backed down!Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:52.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah? That's pathetic!Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:54.78,Main,,0,0,0,,What a loser!Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:58.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess "First Son of the Sea" is only a title. I've lost respect for him.Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:17:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,So he was a coward and a traitor.Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:07.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Jinbe-san...Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:10.84,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were working under Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:14.63,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's why Fishman Island was protected by Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:20.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe is a former Warlord, isn't he?Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:23.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe someone of his stature is her subordinate.Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:26.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook, do you know this man?Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:30.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, he's a very important person to us.Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.61,0:17:36.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,When I fulfill my duties and am free from them,Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.40,0:17:42.08,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I promise I will join your crew.Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:46.65,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I guess he turned down the offer to join our crew that day,Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.65,0:17:50.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,because he wanted to fulfill his duty to Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:56.36,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Now, this article... It doesn't sound like something he'd do.Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:59.28,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He won't come and join us anymore?Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:01.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:06.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Please! I have to go somewhere!Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.95,0:18:11.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing is more important to you now than choosing a dress!Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:14.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop being such a baby-s'il vous plaît, Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.48,0:18:15.71,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:17.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.74,0:18:19.70,Main,,0,0,0,,How about this dress?Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:21.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, it looks good on you!Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:26.29,Main,,0,0,0,,How about this one? I knew it, Pudding-sama! It looks wonderful!Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.29,0:18:29.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Everything looks good on you!Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:32.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Which one do you like, Pudding-sama?Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.06,0:18:33.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Um...Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.35,0:18:36.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama, do you know what the groom likes?Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.71,0:18:40.61,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! No! I've only met him once, so...Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:42.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Whaaat?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.30,0:18:46.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Pudding-san, what is she doing here?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.11,0:18:49.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess she got caught by her attendants.Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I assumed she'd already led Sanji-san outDialogue: 0,0:18:52.54,0:18:55.70,Main,,0,0,0,,to meet with Luffy-san and the others by now.Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:19:00.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Looking at this, I bet Sanji doesn't even know that we're here.Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.29,0:19:03.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, who did Luffy-san see at the shore?Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.95,0:19:08.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Maybe he just saw someone else.Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:16.89,Main,,0,0,0,,That's... If I'm not mistaken, he was on Big Mom's ship...Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.89,0:19:19.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know him very well.Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.17,0:19:21.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Baron Tamago!Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:28.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Baron Tamago, may I speak to you?Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:36.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it-soir?Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.27,0:19:40.24,Main,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat's ship that stopped by at Chocolat Town yesterday...Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:43.16,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They already know!Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:50.33,Main,,0,0,0,,When they left, Mr. Pekoms, who was guiding them, was already gone, they say.Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:52.62,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They know everything!Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.62,0:19:57.89,Main,,0,0,0,,And the four Straw Hats who wandered into the Seducing Woods today.Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.26,0:20:01.72,Note,,0,0,0,,Carrot's poster reads "Bunny Mink."Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.89,0:20:01.72,Main,,0,0,0,,They're already cornered! They're as good as captured!Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:05.51,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san and the others got caught?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.51,0:20:08.77,Main,,0,0,0,,But we still can't find the remaining two.Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.77,0:20:10.93,Note,,0,0,0,,Pedro's Poster Reads "Leopard Mink."Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.77,0:20:10.93,Main,,0,0,0,,These two.Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.98,0:20:13.94,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's us!Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.94,0:20:17.52,Main,,0,0,0,,It's leaked out completely! They knew everything from the start!Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Where were they watching us from?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:24.36,Main,,0,0,0,,That mink is not a leopard-soir.Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:28.53,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a jaguar Mink. His name is Pedro.Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:30.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know him?Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:34.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit from the past.Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.65,0:20:43.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I know what he would do-feuille.Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:48.39,Main,,0,0,0,,– Anyway, I want you guys to look for Pekoms. – Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.83,0:20:55.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekoms. Since he was alive-bon,Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.66,0:20:58.14,Main,,0,0,0,,for the sake of our long-standing partnership,Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.14,0:21:02.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I was going to ask Mama to pardon him.Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:07.95,Main,,0,0,0,,He gives me a lot of trouble-marron.Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.95,0:21:12.79,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,We are in big trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:16.92,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Northeast Coast of Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:21:15.60,0:21:18.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut it out, junior!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:20.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Quiet!Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:30.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's laughing! That's good!Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:30.22,Captions,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Chiffon – Bege's Wife The 22nd Daughter of the Charlotte FamilyDialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:33.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,Capone "Gang" Pez – Bege's SonDialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:38.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Good, good, good, good! You're a good boy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:38.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,Capone "Gang" Bege The Captain of the Fire Tank PiratesDialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:43.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, junior. I hope you'll become a great boss like me one day.Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:49.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't stand watching that! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.97,0:21:52.51,Main,,0,0,0,,He's dazzling, isn't he?Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:55.54,Main,,0,0,0,,He was just born.Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.54,0:21:58.62,Main,,0,0,0,,And you're going to die.Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.11,0:22:05.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's an exquisite contrast? It's like a painting.Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.01,0:22:10.65,Main,,0,0,0,,This is what you chose.Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.65,0:22:13.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekoms. I gave you a chance.Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.85,0:22:17.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It didn't look like a chance to me. Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.85,0:22:20.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Remember what happened to you on Zou.Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:24.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Human empathy isn't worth anything.Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.99,0:22:30.78,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not cut out for this business.Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.45,0:22:36.83,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the perfect place for getting rid of someone.Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:45.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Any last words?Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.24,0:23:14.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You underestimate Mama too much!Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.11,0:23:53.87,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Now, let me see your hands.Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.53,0:23:57.54,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,They're covered in bruises.Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.37,0:24:08.25,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Little brat!Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.80,0:24:10.59,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.06,0:24:17.97,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What's your problem, you damn old geezer?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.97,0:24:22.19,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Are your hands for fighting?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.19,0:24:37.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.58,0:24:42.54,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:24:48.13,0:24:52.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Queen's ChamberDialogue: 0,0:24:52.59,0:24:58.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I think I invested enough money, Caesar Clown.Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.89,0:25:04.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Y-Y-Yes! And of course, I didn't stop researching!Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.70,0:25:07.21,Main,,0,0,0,,My dream is...Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.37,0:25:27.00,Main,,0,0,0,,... for all races in the world to become familyDialogue: 0,0:25:27.00,0:25:31.57,Main,,0,0,0,,and sit around a dining table at the same eye level.Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.57,0:25:34.67,Main,,0,0,0,,They'll drink what I drink,Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.26,0:25:39.97,Main,,0,0,0,,and eat what I eat!Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.81,0:25:50.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a wonderful dream?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.82,0:25:55.28,Main,,0,0,0,,And you're gonna make it come true for me, Caesar!Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.16,0:26:03.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I want you to make my family members gigantic with the power of science.Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.50,0:26:06.89,Main,,0,0,0,,You kept telling me...Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.89,0:26:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,... that you were almost done, but needed a little more research money.Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.50,0:26:17.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I was excited and spent quite a lot of money.Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.32,0:26:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,So how're the results?Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.09,0:26:24.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks to you, they're quite good!Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.96,0:26:29.41,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The gigantification of the human body. Yes, I was doing experiments.Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.41,0:26:33.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The whole world is looking for a technology like that.Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.46,0:26:39.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But I was performing experiments to turn kids into giants. It was deadly.Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.34,0:26:43.72,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to make a drug that'll magicallyDialogue: 0,0:26:43.72,0:26:47.08,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,make people gigantic like this old bag wants.Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.08,0:26:51.38,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's why I just screwed her out of her money, and...Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.05,0:26:58.10,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,... called girls' ships over o the island every night,Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.10,0:27:02.99,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,and spent all the money on alcohol and women!Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.99,0:27:11.86,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Those were the good old days! I was going nuts behind Joker's back!Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.86,0:27:13.06,Note,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo Falls!Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.15,0:27:16.48,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect Joker to be defeated...Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.07,0:27:27.20,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,... and my life to become this miserable!Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.20,0:27:32.33,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Dammit! It was much easier back then!Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.33,0:27:35.25,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is all because of that...Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.25,0:27:37.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you giving a facial performance?Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.91,0:27:40.34,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.34,0:27:46.06,Main,,0,0,0,,This! And that! And everything! This is all Straw Hat Luffy's fault!Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.06,0:27:50.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom! I was doing the research without sleeping at all!Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.98,0:27:54.44,Main,,0,0,0,,And when it was almost complete...Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.44,0:27:58.69,Main,,0,0,0,,... Straw Hat and Trafalgar Law showed up!Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.62,0:28:10.54,Main,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for them, the Gigantism Drug would've been completed!Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.54,0:28:13.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I'm a genius!Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.46,0:28:17.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that the lab built by the World Government,Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.58,0:28:20.17,Main,,0,0,0,,with such a high level of technology, was destroyed!Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.17,0:28:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I could only achieve the results in that perfectly controlled environment!Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.53,0:28:31.73,Main,,0,0,0,,The vast amount of money you invested and that lab!Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.73,0:28:38.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I lost them, so I can't create the Gigantism Drug now!Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.44,0:28:41.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't!Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.02,0:28:57.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I built the exact same lab as the one on Punk Hazard.Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.79,0:28:58.84,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.84,0:29:02.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I got the blueprints to it ages ago.Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.09,0:29:08.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Our Minister of Candy can make anything out of candy.Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.22,0:29:12.19,Main,,0,0,0,,You can spend as much money as you want for the research.Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.19,0:29:13.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.77,0:29:16.94,Main,,0,0,0,,A-A-A-A... A-Are you sure?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.94,0:29:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, I appreciate it!Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.28,0:29:21.15,Main,,0,0,0,,So?Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.76,0:29:22.82,Main,,0,0,0,,"So?"Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.45,0:29:26.36,Main,,0,0,0,,When will it be ready?Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.28,0:29:33.25,Main,,0,0,0,,In a week? Or two weeks?Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.63,0:29:40.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.75,0:29:47.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous! Mankind has been doing this research for centuries,Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.14,0:29:50.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,but no one's ever succeeded!Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.35,0:29:58.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick! Lick!Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.02,0:30:01.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you like that, Caesar-kun?Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.03,0:30:07.20,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems to be quite authentic, doesn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.20,0:30:12.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Perospero – The Minister of Candy The Eldest Son of the Charlotte Family A Candy Human who ate the Lick-Lick FruitDialogue: 0,0:30:08.36,0:30:12.62,Main,,0,0,0,,The inside is exactly like the way it was, too. Lick!Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.29,0:30:19.00,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.00,0:30:21.25,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No! Don't do that!Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.59,0:30:25.84,Main,,0,0,0,,This is fun.Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.18,0:30:33.52,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.98,0:30:38.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We've arrived at the Whole Cake Island.Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.61,0:30:44.36,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hey, Black Leg!Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.36,0:30:47.74,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Give me back my heart before you go!Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.74,0:30:49.61,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Oh.Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.61,0:30:50.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.66,0:31:01.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You only have two weeks to produce the Gigantism Drug!Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.42,0:31:07.55,Main,,0,0,0,,If it takes longer than that, I'll turn you into a "candy man" and lick you!Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.47,0:31:11.50,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll be killed in two weeks!Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.50,0:31:14.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I gotta do something!Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.22,0:31:16.14,Captions,,0,0,0,,Southwest Coast, NightDialogue: 0,0:31:20.73,0:31:24.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I've seen you dozens of times now.Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.36,0:31:29.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It's you again.Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.00,0:31:30.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I found another one.Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.70,0:31:36.90,Main,,0,0,0,,There are so many of them!Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.13,0:31:54.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway...Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.57,0:32:14.62,Main,,0,0,0,,How did you guys multiply?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.62,0:32:19.70,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Infoboxes & Title:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Attack Effects: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:38.34,Note,,0,0